libgssglue
------------------------------------------
Libgssglue provides a GSS-API library, but does not implement any mechanisms
itself; instead it calls routines in other libraries, depending on the
mechanism and system configuration.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  cygwin-devel-3.6.12-1
  libgssglue-devel-0.9-1bl2
  libgssglue1-0.9-1bl2
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20261107-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://gitlab.com/gsasl/libgssglue

Canonical download:
  https://gitlab.com/gsasl/libgssglue/-/archive/libgssglue-0.9/libgssglue-libgssglue-0.9.tar.bz2

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libgssglue-0.9-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libgssglue-0.9-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libgssglue-0.9-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libgssglue-0.9-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libgssglue1-0.9-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libgssglue-devel-0.9-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libgssglue)
  /etc/gssapi_mech.conf
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libgssglue.README
  /usr/share/doc/libgssglue/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/libgssglue/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libgssglue/NEWS
  /usr/share/doc/libgssglue/README
  /usr/share/doc/libgssglue/README.md

(libgssglue1)
  /usr/bin/cyggssglue-1.dll

(libgssglue-devel)
  /usr/include/gssglue/gssapi/gssapi.h
  /usr/lib/libgssglue.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libgssglue.pc

